# justccell.com — production-only workflow

## Default target

All implementation, fixes, and QA for `websites/justccell.com` ship to **justccell.com (production)** only.

- **Hostinger path:** `public_html/wp-content/plugins/justccell-features/` (logic) · `public_html/wp-content/themes/justccell-theme/` (templates/assets)
- **TUS relative prefix:** `wp-content/plugins/justccell-features/{file}` · `wp-content/themes/justccell-theme/{file}`
- **Account:** `u392808260` · WP software id **`30055979`**

## dev.justccell.com — permanently deprecated

**Do not deploy to, test on, or reference `dev.justccell.com`.** Deprecated 2026-09-07 (Master Sync). Production + vault are the single source of truth. Live site stays on coming soon until v1.0.0 go-live.

## Production deploy

After coding, patch production via in-place TUS through **Hostinger MCP**. Do not ask “want me to deploy?” — production deploy is included.

## Pre-launch visibility (production)

Keep **discourage search engines** and **coming soon / maintenance** active on production until go-live is approved. Spec: `websites/justccell.com/docs/dev-environment.md` (visibility section).

## Core sanctity

Never patch WordPress core or WooCommerce core plugin files. All behavioral code lives in `justccell-features` or theme templates/visual assets only.

## CSS / UI work

Before writing or editing storefront CSS for Justccell, read and follow the **UI UX Pro Max** skill (`~/.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md`).

**wp-admin:** never enqueue storefront CSS in admin; narrowly scoped plugin admin CSS for owned modals/widgets only (`rules.md` §13).

## Vault docs

When workflow or deploy target changes, update in the same turn: `docs/dev-environment.md`, `docs/STATUS.md`, `docs/BUILD-LOG.md`.
